From 2ce43dd1611467cc2f11bf299bffde134896e6b4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Zack Maril <zmaril@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 16:32:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/6] rustc_metadata: encode each definition and its MIR in
 helpers

Moves the bodies of the loops in `encode_def_ids` and `encode_mir` into
`encode_info_for_def` and `encode_mir_for`, so a definition can be encoded
on its own. No change in behavior; most of the diff is indentation.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
